From: Wisnuu <wisnuandrian325@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:08:48 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 11/19] feat(katalyst): add modern agent sidebar with New Chat,
 Projects section, and pin badge; fix worktree pollution

- Add dedicated New Chat button row at top of sidebar
- Add Projects section header with native Add Folder to Project picker
- Add persistent SQLite-backed thread pinning with always-visible pin badge
- Fix worktree pollution by filtering single-file worktrees and auto-purging accidental file roots
- Fix markdown preview blank race-condition on newly opened plan files
- Add CHANGELOG.md documenting v0.1.0 release notes
